<p>Suggs’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$38.94m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$97.36m</strong> in career earnings. One outlet puts him at <strong>$5m</strong>, which predates this extension and sits at a twentieth of what he has been paid.</p>
<p>He played one season at Gonzaga and Orlando took him fifth in 2021, six weeks after he turned 20.</p>

