<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jalen-suggs/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jalen-suggs/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Jalen Suggs’s Salary With the Magic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Suggs earns $32.4m in 2026-27, fourth at Orlando and the second year of a five-year extension. It falls from $35m last season. His career earnings come to $97.36m across six seasons, all at Orlando. The salary is 15.44% of the club’s $209.87m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Jalen Suggs Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Three more guaranteed seasons follow this one, running to 2029-30. The salary keeps falling across them. He reaches free agency in 2030 at 29."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Jalen Suggs Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $32.4m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Jalen Suggs’s Contract With the Magic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Suggs signed a five-year extension worth $150.5m with Orlando in 2024, all of it guaranteed. The salary falls from $35m in the first year, which is unusual and means the cap hit gets lighter as the deal runs. He reaches free agency in 2030 at 29."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Jalen Suggs’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Suggs’s net worth is estimated at around $38.94m, taken from his $97.36m in career earnings. One outlet puts him at $5m, which predates this extension and sits at a twentieth of what he has been paid. He played one season at Gonzaga and Orlando took him fifth in 2021, six weeks after he turned 20."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Jalen Suggs Paid $32.4m on His Rookie Extension?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Suggs is paid $32.4m because Orlando extended him off his rookie contract at a flat number, and wrote the money to fall each year."}}]}</script>
